  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are susceptible to Islamophobic beliefs, particularly those who may be politically motivated to discredit Barack Obama by leveraging religious stereotypes. The meme is designed to incite prejudice against Muslims by falsely equating Obama’s embrace with Hillary Clinton to a 'Muslim hugging a pig,' which is a derogatory metaphor rooted in Islamophobic tropes. The intended audience likely includes people who are already predisposed to anti-Muslim sentiment, or those who are politically aligned with narratives that delegitimize Obama’s leadership based on his faith. The meme also targets those who may not be aware of the false equivalence, aiming to spread misinformation and hatred by exploiting religious and cultural stereotypes.",
